# 逆転裁判2 (Gyakuten Saiban 2, AGB-A3GJ): the game's own numbers for its characters, as the script has them
# (16-bit, the low byte first, so 00C0 is written C000). The font is in the cartridge at 0x1AA3A8 + 128 x the
# code, four 4-bit tiles a glyph, codes 0x80 to 0x607. Of its glyphs 1,191 are the same, bit for bit, as a glyph
# of Gyakuten Saiban's font (games/gba/AGB-ASBJ.tbl) and take that reading; 221 others were read here off
# sheets of the glyphs, once, by one reader. Left out: 0x0326, 0x0501 (a plain bar) and 0x05FD, not settled
# from their pictures, and 0x05DF (a filled square).
